Z||000007||Fformula88||10-21-2000||10:50 PM||||Adding on better exhausts and other go-fast parts is certainly not a ricer mod.  No matter what it looks like.  Your exhaust may have a big shiney tip on the end, but since its attached to a good exhaust its not a rice mod.  The rice mod would have been taking a large tip and sticking it on the end of your stock exhaust.<P>As far as stickers go... if you actually have the item on your car that the sticker advertises, then its not really a rice mod.  However, every Honda and Acura you see with a Type R sticker on it is a rice mod sticker... unless its the actual Integra Type R.  Most of them are not.  <P>Hey Count... have you been to  <A HREF="http://www.probetalk.com" TARGET=_blank>www.probetalk.com</A> ?  Its a great Probe messageboard... very similar to this board.  I have a 97 Probe SE, and think its ther best Probe board.  <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">  <BR>1988 Fiero Formula||||reg||1
